## 8. Page Registry

Tracks the intended clean URL against the confirmed actual permalink for every static Page, so drift between the two is caught immediately rather than discovered as a blank-page incident.

| Page | Intended URL | Confirmed Actual URL | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| Terms of Service | `/p/terms.html` | *(re-verify after recreation per Section 6)* | ⬜ Pending |
| Privacy Policy | `/p/privacy-policy.html` | `/p/privacy-policy.html` | ✅ Confirmed |
| Cookies | `/p/cookies.html` | — | ⬜ Not yet created |
| Accessibility | `/p/accessibility.html` | — | ⬜ Not yet created |
| Disclaimer | `/p/disclaimer.html` | — | ⬜ Not yet created |
| Categories | `/p/categories.html` | — | ⬜ Not yet created |
| Blog | `/p/blog.html` | — | ⬜ Not yet created |
| Resources | `/p/resources.html` | — | ⬜ Not yet created |
| About | `/p/about.html` | — | ⬜ Not yet created |
| Contact | `/p/contact.html` | — | ⬜ Not yet created |

**Rule:** a page's Status only moves to ✅ Confirmed after its actual permalink has been verified (Section 5) and matches the Intended URL exactly. If they don't match, either fix the page's URL (Section 7) or update every reference to it in `Base_Layout.xml` — never leave the two silently out of sync.

**বাংলা নিয়ম:** কোনো পেজের Status তখনই ✅ Confirmed হবে যখন তার প্রকৃত permalink যাচাই করা হয়েছে (Section ৫) এবং সেটি Intended URL-এর সাথে হুবহু মিলছে। না মিললে, হয় পেজের URL ঠিক করুন (Section ৭), অথবা `Base_Layout.xml`-এর প্রতিটি reference আপডেট করুন —
দুটোকে কখনো নীরবে অসামঞ্জস্যপূর্ণ (out of sync) রেখে দেবেন না।

